4 hours␀␀␀Mesh health: a flood advert is rebroadcast by every repeater in range, so frequent floods add airtime for the whole network. Keep them infrequent (a day or more). Your neighbours still see you from zero-hop adverts and your message replies, so flood mainly when distant nodes need to rediscover you. Leave both Off to advertise only when you tap the buttons above.␀␀␀␀Join private channel␀␀␀␀Enter the 32-hex secret shared by the channel creator.␀␀Channel name␀␀␀␀Secret (32 hex chars)␀␀␀32 hex characters␀␀␀Create private channel␀␀Share the 32-char secret so others can join. Leave the secret empty to generate a random one.␀␀␀e.g. Family␀Secret (32 hex, optional)␀␀␀leave empty to generate␀Create␀␀Add channel␀Join Public channel␀Join # channel␀␀î’—␀Discovered nodes␀␀␀␀î…‘␀Search contacts␀î‡␀Sort␀␀␀␀Select all␀␀Paste the 64-hex public key and a name. Useful when you want to DM someone before their advert has arrived.␀Public key (64 hex chars)␀␀␀0123456789abcdefâ€¦␀Display name␀␀␀␀ï®  Search contacts␀␀␀␀Name fragment␀␀␀ï”™␀ï€‡␀Discovered␀␀chats␀␀␀rooms␀␀␀Auto-add on for %s â€” new %s land in Contacts automatically.␀␀␀No discovered nodes yet.

